{"id":"f1979a0de445d6e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Foundation Wellfounded Part","display":"df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part — ZFC Set10 Foundation Wellfounded Part","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part — ZFC Set10 Foundation Wellfounded Part","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part — ZFC Set10 Foundation Wellfounded Part"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md\">../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,A \\in V\">\\(W,A \\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A(a)\">\\(D_A(a)\\)</span> is the downward membership closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}\\)</span> is the well-founded-relation predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7308daa58e0345ed\" href=\"?note=7308daa58e0345ed\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md\">../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A:A\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(D_A:A\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>；其定义式只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 上使用，且交族包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}downward\\text{-}closure}\\vdash a\\in A\\to D_A(a)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq A:a\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(x\\cap A\\subseteq D)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}downward\\text{-}closure}\\vdash a\\in A\\to D_A(a)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq A:a\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(x\\cap A\\subseteq D)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S(W,A)\\leftrightarrow W=\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{WF}(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D_A(a)\\times D_A(a):x\\in y\\},D_A(a))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S(W,A)\\leftrightarrow W=\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{WF}(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D_A(a)\\times D_A(a):x\\in y\\},D_A(a))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元素 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 当且仅当从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 出发、始终留在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 内的成员前驱结构良基。</li>\n<li>原来的“最大良基限制子集”刻画并不唯一：一个有向环可以通过删去不同节点得到多个极大良基子集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md","status":"resolved","id":"7308daa58e0345ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WF}$ is the well-founded-relation predicate from [[../batch01/58-df-wellfounded.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,A \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D_A(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D_A:A\\to\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}downward\\text{-}closure}\\vdash a\\in A\\to D_A(a)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{D\\subseteq A:a\\in D\\land\\forall x\\in D\\;(x\\cap A\\subseteq D)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}foundation\\text{-}wellfounded\\text{-}part} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10FoundationWellfoundedPart}_S(W,A)\\leftrightarrow W=\\{a\\in A:\\mathrm{WF}(\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D_A(a)\\times D_A(a):x\\in y\\},D_A(a))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1511,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3382","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part.md|58-df-zfc-set10-foundation-wellfounded-part]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7308daa58e0345ed"]}